kernel kernel(a: [2, 4], b: [2, 4])
  kernel_out: shared_hbm[2, 4] of a.dtype
  x: sbuf[2, 4] of a.dtype
  y: sbuf[2, 4] of b.dtype
  z: sbuf[2, 4] of a.dtype
  dma_copy(dst=x, src=a)
  dma_copy(dst=y, src=b)
  tensor_tensor(data1=x, data2=y, dst=z, op=nki.language.multiply)
  dma_copy(dst=kernel_out, src=z)
  return kernel_out
